      "text": "This itinerary links four very different parts of Ecuador. Begin in Quito, exploring the colonial centre, its squares and churches, and taking in views across the highland capital. Then head to the equator and Cotopaxi National Park, where volcanic landscapes surround Lake Limpiopungo and give way to high-altitude Andean ecosystems."
